<title>HONG KONG: HK Rolling Forex trading shortened on Thursday.</title>
<headline>HK Rolling Forex trading shortened on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Futures Exchange said on Wednesday trading hours for Rolling Forex will close at midnight (1600 GMT) on Thursday instead of the usual 4 a.m. (2000 GMT) due to the Thanksgiving holiday in the United States.</p>
<p>The shortened hours apply to the Deutschemark, Japanese yen and British pound contracts, it said. Normal trading will resume at 8 a.m. on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
